OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy to start with
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy rain, and some
OL,7,Fblustery winds at times. This soon
OL,8,Fclears east through the morning to
OL,9,Fallow increasing bright spells and a
OL,10,Ffew showers.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry through the evening with
OL,13,Fincreasing clear spells and light
OL,14,Fwinds. Staying dry and becoming chilly
OL,15,Fovernight with a rural grass frost
OL,16,Fdeveloping in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
