OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FDry and bright but chilly
OL,6,Fstart. Sunshine turning hazy as cloud
OL,7,Fgradually spills east through the
OL,8,Fafternoon ahead of rain in the
OL,9,Fevening. Gusty winds developing.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FAny
OL,12,Fcloud and rain clearing east on Friday
OL,13,Fmorning to become dry with sunny
OL,14,Fspells. Bright spells and a few
OL,15,Fshowers in west on Saturday. Rain
OL,16,Fspreads east on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
